{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1159559-ideas-for-an-aberrant-campaign","id":1159559,"title":"Ideas for an Aberrant Campaign","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum","Trinity Continuum: Aberrant"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-11-16T14:14:38-08:00","id":1159559,"title":"Ideas for an Aberrant Campaign","content":"Please list your ideas for an interesting Aberrant campaign. A world that doesn't necessarily have costume superheroes but people with super powers trying to &quot;make it&quot;. The heroes could be good people trying to do what's right, and bad people trying to do what's best for them without caring for others. <br /> <br /> In addition, anyone who would be into an Aberrant pbp let me know by responding here. Thanks.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","name":"wtaylorjr2001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-17T22:09:03-08:00","id":1160124,"title":"","content":"Here's a simple one:<br /> <br /> Our world, now;<br /> Longstanding hostilities building up in Southeast Asia, coupled with fluctuating levels of instability in the Middle-east, as well as an unreliable and uncertain world economy, dim the peoples\u2019 views of the future. Falling into old patterns, standing world governments can only think to cloister themselves in their own territories and build up military strength. With that strategy foremost in their minds, the first of novakind publicly erupts at a demonstration (covered by CNN) in against the ruling regime of an underdeveloped nation. The initial event is assumed to be a hoax, yet all major nations begin secretly scrambling for answers. <br /> It is only after four more such eruptions happen in nations such as India, China, Brazil, and Nigeria on live television (simultaneously captured on camera-phones and/or streamed to the internet live) that the world reacts to the event as if it were truth. The internet explodes immediately with speculation, supposed sightings, posted and re-posted articles, and all the other trappings of internet fame.<br /> It is during the media frenzy\u2019s highest point, when (your nation\u2019s) military first starts looking for recruits that you erupt. Any day now the recruiters will be beating down your door, will you try and keep your eruption under wraps, sign on in exchange for government benefits, or find a third option?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/765-darksol-aeternium","name":"Darksol-aeternium","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar765_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"392"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-19T05:38:29-08:00","id":1160493,"title":"","content":"start with the idea that the players work for N! and probably have tv shows there. this can lead to 'adventure of the week- on location' easily as the studio can send them to a place for whatever reason, such as a holiday celebration, or just wanting news coverage of that tropical paradise alongside the cruise advertisements.....<br /> <br /> along the way, you can explore the setting, and let the players change the way the world is by being the one you trust for your morning news, or the childrens tv show, or just cooking with a nova. its a great way to explore new ideas without needing to push combat too much (and easily have security if combat is expected), with fame and resources being the common result of this (low resources could just be a really bad contract).<br /> <br /> right now, if people had powers suddely, the tv media is a place they could easily end up.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4695-teulisch","name":"Teulisch","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"14"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}